{"Title":"An Act amending the charter of the town of Westborough","BillNumber":"H4202","DocketNumber":"HD4696","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"K_D1","Name":"Kate Donaghue","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/K_D1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T20:21:07.643"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"K_D1","Name":"Kate Donaghue","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/K_D1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T20:21:07.6433333"},{"Id":"HEK1","Name":"Hannah Kane","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/HEK1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T21:02:53.3466667"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-29T17:24:04.4266667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"HEK1","Name":"Hannah Kane","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/HEK1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T20:58:19.98"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4202/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Donaghue of Westborough and Kane of Shrewsbury, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4202) of Kate Donaghue and Hannah Kane (by vote of the town) for legislation to amend the charter of the town of Westborough.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection (d) of section 3-2 of article 3 of the charter of the town of Westborough, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth, as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by inserting the following words:\r\n\tThe Select Board may delegate appointing authority for the Housing Partnership Committee to any municipal housing trust established by the Town, provided that the Declaration of Trust includes the authority to serve as appointing authority for the Housing Partnership Committee.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}